# Source material — never commit private reference documents
Books/

# Generated PMO artifacts may contain confidential product/roadmap data.
# This template tracks the folder READMEs (the structure) but ignores generated
# content. Uncomment to keep your own artifacts in git, or commit selectively.
# knowledge/prds/*
# knowledge/sprints/*
# knowledge/projects/*
# knowledge/launches/*
# knowledge/ceremonies/*
# !knowledge/**/README.md

